{"id":"607830","name":"干南瓜馅包子","author":"兰杏梅","authorId":"12270318","desc":"","cover":"images/607830/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"干南瓜","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"酵母","amount":"少许"},{"name":"牛奶","amount":"250ml"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"少许"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"干南瓜备用。","img":"images/607830/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"泡一夜，挤出多余水分。","img":"images/607830/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"蒜备用。","img":"images/607830/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"南瓜和蒜剁碎，放入盆中。","img":"images/607830/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入适量盐和少许鸡精，浇一勺热油，拌匀即可。","img":"images/607830/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"面粉中加酵母、白糖和牛奶，搅拌成絮状，醒发两倍大，揉成光滑面团。","img":"images/607830/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"搓成长条状。","img":"images/607830/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"切成大小均匀的剂子。","img":"images/607830/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"擀成中间厚四周薄的包子皮。","img":"images/607830/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"包入馅料。","img":"images/607830/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"已包好。","img":"images/607830/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"冷水上笼。","img":"images/607830/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"大火烧开转中火蒸十五分钟，关火焖五分钟。","img":"images/607830/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"已蒸好。","img":"images/607830/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/607830/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"软软的。","img":"images/607830/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"颜值也不错。","img":"images/607830/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"掰开，香。","img":"images/607830/step_18.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}